# Frontend converter

- Server-render marketing text. Load converter JS progressively.
- Stages: Uploading, Waiting, Converting, Checking output. No fake percentages.
- Explicit CTA: Convert resume to Word. Keyboard file picker required.
- Do not delete on download. Same-tab resume only; no secrets in the URL.
- Map failures from `vault/06-quality/Failure Catalog.md`.
- Target WCAG 2.2 AA on the core flow. Verify in the browser, not by screenshot alone.
